{% markdown %}

## What did a token change prove?

**A change at the source carries through to designers' work.** I changed a core UNDRR spacing token from 30px to 32px and republished the library. In a pilot file of 56 linked library instances, a resource page at desktop and mobile widths, the layout updated and every edited title, chosen preset and instance override survived.

**Designers don't need the plugin to use the library.** The pilot was built entirely from the published library, with its own headings and local notes. The plugin is my build tool; designers only ever touch the library.

